    "The context of the genre recalls why those tags matter and why they are never enough on their own. Bouyon was born in Dominica at the end of the 1980s, and <a href=\"/en/bouyon-soca.html\">bouyon soca</a> was started in Dominica in 2003 by <a href=\"/en/dada.html\">Dada</a>, according to the first hand testimony of Smokiller, a Dominican-born producer and a participant in that era. Since then, the word bouyon has become a season tag that pages lay down in order to be found by DJs and listeners, between bouyonriddim and bouyon2026, exactly as on the page of “selfish”. A genre tag laid down by the page of the artist stands as a published filing, and this profile takes it as such. A place tag laid down in the same block, contradicted by another in the following block, does not stand as an origin, and this profile leaves it aside, saying so.",
